 The evaluation follows one of two paths depending on whether ground truth neural fields are available and used [S1, unofficial].
 1. **Ground Truth Path:** If `use_gt_ne` is true and `ne_field` is not None:
-   a. Map the input AABB coordinate $\mathbf{x}_{AABB}$ to physical coordinates: $\mathbf{x}_{xyz} = \mathbf{x}_{AABB} \times \text{aabb\_scale}$.
-   b. Query the neural field: $\text{log10\_ne} = \text{ne\_field}(\mathbf{x}_{xyz})$.
-   c. If `clamp` is true, clamp the value: $\text{log10\_ne} = \max(\text{log\_ne\_min}, \min(\text{log10\_ne}, \text{log\_ne\_max}))$.
-   d. Compute linear density: $ne = 10.0^{\text{log10\_ne}}$.
